# Cover Letter Crew — API Keys
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the key for the provider you want to use.
# Only ONE key is needed. The Streamlit sidebar lets you switch at runtime.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# OPTION 1: Ollama (Free — local, no key needed)
# Pull a model first: ollama pull qwen3.5:9b
# Or for DeepSeek local: ollama pull deepseek-r1:7b
# No key required — leave all variables below commented out.
# Optional: context window for local models (default 16384). Lower it if you
# run out of RAM, e.g. OLLAMA_NUM_CTX=8192
#OLLAMA_NUM_CTX=16384

# OPTION 2: DeepSeek API (~$0.002 per full run — cheapest cloud option)
# Get your key at: https://platform.deepseek.com
#DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-deepseek-key-here

# OPTION 3: Anthropic Claude (Haiku ~$0.01 · Sonnet ~$0.05 · Opus ~$0.20)
# Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com
#ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-key-here

# OPTION 4: OpenAI ChatGPT (4o-mini ~$0.01 · 4o ~$0.05)
# Get your key at: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-key-here

# OPTION 5: Google Gemini (Flash free tier · Pro ~$0.01)
# Get your key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#GOOGLE_API_KEY=your-google-key-here

# OPTION 6: Groq (Free tier — very fast inference)
# Get your key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
#GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-key-here

# OPTION 7: OpenRouter (100+ models, many free)
# Get your key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
#OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-key-here
